  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Korniszon227/videos?sub_confirmation=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1392449/description_925ade96-1d9b-4f2d-bf86-6b9ffb05f92b.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"70\"></a></em><em><a href=\"https://discord.gg/UmbU38vg2r\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1392449/description_8b603dbf-8b49-4e57-b9dd-5cd817c64a43.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"70\"></a></em><em><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252feasy-vaccine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1392449/description_36521f72-2fb0-4688-9b79-d8224d709b31.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"70\"></a></em><em><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252fannoy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1392449/description_9a2b8df6-5481-4291-a5e5-3b079c703c3b.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"70\"></a></em></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Обновление 1.1 Enhance уже доступно</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Мод создан для сборки модов <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/final-protocol\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Final Protocol</a></em></p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>ШПРИЦ</strong></h1>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1265044/description_f20abb8d-cc75-4c8a-a06b-f8bb9d4cfd19.png\" width=\"272\" height=\"146\"></p>\n<h1 style-align:center\"><strong>ДНК ЗОМБИ + КИПЯЧЕНИЕ</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1265044/description_ecce88ee-6909-4285-9393-df6d46622813.png\" width=\"273\" height=\"141\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1265044/description_e74ef2e3-be3c-47a7-9460-ebba078fbb84.png\" width=\"215\" height=\"141\"></strong></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>ВАКЦИНА</strong></h1>\n<p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1265044/description_815e9346-b4eb-4b78-ad1f-775e2f0f3ff0.png\" width=\"287\" height=\"151\"></strong></p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>РУКОВОДСТВО</strong></h1>\n<p>&gt; Чтобы использовать этот мод, сначала необходимо правильно настроить конфигурацию для мода \"Hordes\".</p>\n<p>&gt; Перейдите к файлу \"infection_cures.json\", показанному на скриншоте ниже</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_71ca97d0-ed16-40a7-bc2c-480d5e73485c.png\" width=\"321\" height=\"220\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&gt; Код внутри должен выглядеть следующим образом:</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_90ca2064-f0e8-412a-a811-e72b714ede3e.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>\n<div>{</div>\n<div>\"replace\": false,</div>\n<div>\"values\": [</div>\n<div>\"annoyvaccine:vaccine\"</div>\n<div>]</div>\n<div>}</div>\n</div>",
